## 2. No rights granted by access

Access to this repository — including membership in the project
distribution list, collaborator status, pull request access, or any other
form of participation — does **not** grant any right to copy, modify for
external use, redistribute, sublicense, publish, sell, or otherwise
release any part of the Software outside of the project.

## 3. Permitted contributor activity

A person who is a member of the project or who has been expressly
authorized to contribute (a "Contributor") may, solely for the purpose of
contributing to the Software within this repository:

- view, edit, and save changes to the Software;
- submit pull requests and participate in code review; and
- build and test the Software locally for that purpose.

Contributor rights are limited to the acts listed above. A Contributor
**may not** copy, extract, mirror, fork for external distribution,
relicense, publish, or release any portion of the Software or any
derivative work, in whole or in part, outside of this project, in any
form, for any purpose, without a separate written license from the PokoX
project.

## 4. No external release

No Contributor may release, publish, distribute, or make available any
build, binary, asset, document, or other output derived from the Software
to any third party. Release of any kind requires a separate written
agreement.

## 5. Confidentiality

The Software and all non-public information encountered through it are
confidential. Contributors must not disclose non-public information
outside the project except as required by law or as authorized in
writing.

## 6. Third-party components

Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses (for example,
